          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16">
            <!-- Left Column: Overview -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
              <div class="space-y-4">
                <span
                  class="text-sky-700 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs"
                  >Overview</span
                >
                <h2
                  class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight"
                >
                  Why Learn Agentic AI, Generative AI & LLM Engineering?
                </h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
                  Artificial intelligence is moving beyond traditional machine learning toward systems that can understand instructions, reason through tasks, use tools, retrieve information, generate content, and work through multi-step workflows.
                  <br /><br />
                  The Sky States Agentic AI & Generative AI Professional Program is designed for technology professionals who want to develop practical skills in modern AI application development, LLM engineering, AI agents, automation, and intelligent systems.
                  <br /><br />
                  Learn how to build AI-powered applications using modern frameworks and technologies while developing the practical experience needed to showcase your skills through projects and a professional portfolio.
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- Pricing / Overview Card -->
              <div
                class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-4 mt-4"
              >
                <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-850">
                  Agentic AI & Generative AI Program Overview
                </h4>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
                  A practical, project-focused program covering the technologies used to build modern AI applications and intelligent workflows.
